  "title": "What to Expect in EMDR Therapy Sessions",
  "sourceUrl": "",
  "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1768791149790\" id=\"item-696d9c30cfc91f7a3f9fd5a8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"01449a83784b328a2780\" id=\"block-01449a83784b328a2780\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Starting trauma therapy can feel intimidating. Knowing what to expect can help reduce fear and uncertainty.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/news/2026/1/18/emdr-therapy-for-trauma-and-ptsd-in-tyler-tx\"><strong>EMDR Therapy for Trauma and PTSD in Tyler, TX</strong></a></p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your First EMDR Sessions</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">EMDR does <strong>not</strong> begin with trauma processing right away. Early sessions focus on:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Building trust</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Learning coping skills</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ensuring emotional safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your therapist will never rush the process.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">During an EMDR Session</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A typical EMDR session includes:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Brief focus on a memory</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bilateral stimulation</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Noticing thoughts, emotions, or sensations</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Allowing the brain to naturally shift</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You remain fully aware and in control.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Is EMDR Overwhelming?</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Most clients are surprised by how manageable EMDR feels. Sessions are paced carefully and always end with grounding and stabilization.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">EMDR Therapy in Tyler, TX</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At The Bridge, EMDR sessions are tailored to your comfort level and personal goals.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/schedule-an-apointment\"><strong>Schedule an appointment</strong> </a>to learn more.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-01449a83784b328a2780 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-01449a83784b328a2780 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-01449a83784b328a2780 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-01449a83784b328a2780 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-01449a83784b328a2780 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-01449a83784b328a2780 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n     